{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"77e02410-31b0-4d1e-b310-2cb19c80e02a","status":"SUCCESS","response":"{\"findings\":[{\"area\":\"specification\",\"criterion\":\"C01-C12\",\"observation\":\"SPEC.md covers all contract constraints accurately, including strict 131072-byte stdin limits, NDJSON framing, duplicate key and non-finite number rejection, DAG validation, independent calculation of order and layers, and batch atomicity on invalid input.\"},{\"area\":\"design\",\"decision\":\"D01-D06\",\"observation\":\"DESIGN.md correctly distinguishes Kahn algorithm with a min-heap for global lexicographical topological ordering from round-based layer calculation, addresses edge deduplication prior to in-degree computation, and evaluates appropriate rejected alternatives.\"},{\"area\":\"tasks_and_traceability\",\"plan\":\"T01-T07\",\"observation\":\"TASKS.md provides clear traceability back to criteria and design points, establishes appropriate verification categories V01-V07 without executing premature tests, and preserves staged delivery boundaries.\"}],\"reason\":\"The specification, design alternatives, and task breakdown in SPEC.md, DESIGN.md, and TASKS.md fully adhere to the contract requirements, correctly addressing all algorithmic constraints, framing edge cases, and batch atomicity without prematurely executing tests or implementing code.\",\"schema\":1,\"tests_executed\":false,\"verdict\":\"accept\"}\n","duration_seconds":16.86992252,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":26669,"output_tokens":1938,"thinking_tokens":1702,"cache_read_tokens":0,"total_tokens":28607}}}
